  "title": "H&P and GeoPark announce three-year drilling agreement in Vaca Muerta",
  "summary": "H&P and GeoPark have entered into a three-year agreement to deploy a FlexRig® with integrated technology, along with associated drilling services, in the Vaca Muerta formation in Argentina. Under the agreement, H&P will support GeoPark’s factory drilling campaign of horizontal wells in the Loma Jarillosa Este and Puesto Silva Oeste blocks, with operations expected to […]",
